              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Base bethi: “Wozani sicebe amacebo ngoJeremiya; ngokuba umthetho awuyikubhubha kumpristi, neseluleko sohlakaniphileyo nezwi lomprofethi. Wozani simshaye ngolimi, singanaki amazwi akhe.",
          "type": "text",
