          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho nikela abantwana babo endlaleni, bachithe igazi labo ngobudlova benkemba; nabafazi babo mabaphangwe abantwana, babe abafelokazi; futhi amadoda abo mawabulawe; izinsizwa zabo mazibulawe ngenkemba empini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
