              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makuzwakale ukukhala ezindlini zabo, lapho uletha iviyo phezu kwabo ngokuzuma; ngoba bemba umgodi wokungibamba, bafihlela inyawo zami imijibila.",
          "type": "text",
