        {
          "text": "Kepha wena Jehova, uyawazi wonke amasu abo okungibulala; ungathetheleli ububi babo, ungasusi isono sabo ebusweni bakho, kodwa mabaphenduke phambi kwakho; yenza kanjalo kubo ngesikhathi solaka lwakho.",
